  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Inom ramen f&#xf6;r V&#xe4;rldsbankens kredit (5 MUSD) f&#xf6;r sm&#xe5; och medelstora f&#xf6;retag i RS, BiH, finansierar Sida tv&#xe5; experter p&#xe5; utl&#xe5;ning samt en expert p&#xe5; f&#xf6;retagsledning. Projektet kommer att vara 18 m&#xe5;nader. Kostnad 5.900.000 SEK.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WB will make available a credit line (5 MUSD) to private business enterprises in RS. Sida is financing the experts required for the Credit Implementation Support and Enterprise Support in the WB pilot credit programme. Duration 18 months. Cost 5.900.000 SEK</narrative>
